OL,3,GNEWSACharities use council HQ to offer
OL,4,Afrontline help
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo charities have increased the number
OL,7,Fof vulnerable people they support by
OL,8,Fmaking use of space at a town council's
OL,9,FHQ.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire MIND and Citizens
OL,12,FAdvice (CA) have started holding
OL,13,Fsessions at Corby Town Council's
OL,14,Fbuilding in the High Street.
OL,16,FThe council said it wanted the building
OL,17,Fto become a base for community groups
OL,18,Fto offer frontline help. The official
OL,19,Fopening of the initiative took place
OL,20,Flast week.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
